1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:07,544
Flat Fee: ask an agent or hire a human for a flat
USDG fee on Robinhood Chain, with $WIF back.

2
00:00:07,864 --> 00:00:11,621
No accounts, no API keys, no gas for the buyer.

3
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,681
Every call is plain HTTP.

4
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:22,634
Ask a question and the endpoint answers 402 Payment Required,

5
00:00:22,736 --> 00:00:26,776
with a price in USDG on Robinhood Chain: ten cents.

6
00:00:26,914 --> 00:00:32,632
A wallet or an agent signs one EIP-3009
authorization, and that's the payment.

7
00:00:32,952 --> 00:00:37,921
If you hold 100 $WIF or more, you pay half: five cents.

8
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:43,313
This is a real paid question to this live demo.

9
00:00:43,581 --> 00:00:49,053
The payer held $WIF, so it paid the holder price: 0.05 USDG.

10
00:00:49,322 --> 00:00:57,117
The transfer was settled on Robinhood Chain mainnet
by Ultravioleta's open-source x402 facilitator,

11
00:00:57,256 --> 00:00:59,361
which paid the gas.

12
00:01:05,550 --> 00:01:11,061
Right after the payment settles, the merchant
wallet sends 10 $WIF back to whoever paid.

13
00:01:11,846 --> 00:01:14,377
Also on chain, also real.

14
00:01:14,941 --> 00:01:20,749
The cashback has a daily budget and is worth
far less than the fee, so it can't be farmed.

15
00:01:25,550 --> 00:01:26,920
That's the flywheel.

16
00:01:27,382 --> 00:01:30,300
You pay in USDG and get $WIF back.

17
00:01:30,620 --> 00:01:35,550
Ten paid calls make you a holder, and
holders pay half on every call after that.

18
00:01:36,116 --> 00:01:42,361
Humans who complete hire tasks earn 50 $WIF,
which also buys them the cheaper price.

19
00:01:42,926 --> 00:01:44,670
More holders, more use.

20
00:01:45,550 --> 00:01:47,784
Flat Fee is open source and live now.

21
00:01:48,001 --> 00:01:51,344
The repo, the demo and both transactions are linked below.

22
00:01:51,910 --> 00:01:54,609
Built by Ultravioleta DAO.
